        narration: "ICM, yani Independent Chip Model, chip'lerinin ger\xE7ek para de\u011Ferini \xF6l\xE7er \u2014 ve turnuvada chip para de\u011Fildir, kaybetti\u011Fin chip kazand\u0131\u011F\u0131ndan daha \xE7ok ac\u0131t\u0131r. Ama ICM her masada ayn\u0131 s\u0131k\u0131l\u0131kta a\xE7\u0131k de\u011Fildir. Ayn\u0131 yirmi sekiz big blind, ayn\u0131 el, ayn\u0131 pozisyon: k\xFC\xE7\xFCk sahal\u0131 y\xFCksek stakes'te ICM karar\u0131d\u0131r, b\xFCy\xFCk sahal\u0131 Main event'in ilk g\xFCn\xFCnde saf chip karar\u0131d\u0131r. Tabloya bak: k\xFC\xE7\xFCk saha ve dik \xF6deme olan event'lerde ICM erken a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r, neredeyse her Day 2 karar\u0131 ICM alt\u0131ndad\u0131r; Main gibi b\xFCy\xFCk rec-a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 sahada ge\xE7 a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r. Bu ayr\u0131m\u0131 masada de\u011Fil, \xF6nceden yapm\u0131\u015F ol. Saha boyutunu ve \xF6deme y\xFCzdelerini uydurma \u2014 kay\u0131t say\u0131s\u0131na g\xF6re lobiden oku. Ve karar s\u0131rana s\u0131f\u0131r\u0131nc\u0131 ad\u0131m\u0131 ekle: bu event'te ICM a\xE7\u0131k m\u0131? Cevap hay\u0131rsa saf chip oyna; evetse a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki risk d\xFCzeltmelerini uygula."
