        narration: "\u015Eimdi senin kendi kalibre e\u015Fiklerin \u2014 genel teori de\u011Fil, senin verin. Cover ediliyorsan, yani seni ge\xE7en bir chip leader yirmi iki big blind civar\u0131 sert baloncukta sana jam att\u0131ysa: call aral\u0131\u011F\u0131n sekiz sekiz ve \xFCst\xFC, as jek suited ve \xFCst\xFC, ve as k\u0131z offsuit. As dokuz suited ve kral k\u0131z suited'i foldlars\u0131n. Sebep a\xE7\u0131k: kaybedersen elenirsin, s\u0131f\u0131r euro; as dokuz suited ters-domine, kral k\u0131z bir flip \u2014 marjinal kenar tournament life'a de\u011Fmez. Ama madalyonun as\u0131l y\xFCz\xFC, senin s\u0131z\u0131nt\u0131n\u0131n ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131 taraf: cover edilmiyorsan. Jammer senden k\u0131saysa, yani kaybetsen bile elenmeyeceksen, \xE7izgin \xE7ok daha geni\u015Ftir \u2014 as dokuz suited ve kral on offsuit bile call'd\u0131r. Drill verinde bunlar\u0131 bile foldlad\u0131n, 'range yetersiz' diye; oysa kral on offsuit geni\u015F bir on \xFC\xE7 big blind jam'ine yakla\u015F\u0131k y\xFCzde elli d\xF6rt equity'ye sahip, fiyat i\xE7in y\xFCzde k\u0131rk d\xF6rt yeter. Yani hata call de\u011Fil, fold reflexidir \u2014 ve covered'la not-covered'\u0131 yan yana g\xF6rd\xFCkten sonra bile s\xFCrd\xFC. Masa cue'sunu ezberle: jam'e fold basmadan \xF6nce bir saniye dur ve sor, cover ediliyor muyum? Hay\u0131rsa, call aral\u0131\u011F\u0131n sand\u0131\u011F\u0131ndan \xE7ok daha geni\u015F."
