        "ruleBox": "Kuru board'da k\xFC\xE7\xFCk boy varsay\u0131lan kal\u0131r \u2014 ama nut avantaj\u0131n b\xFCy\xFCk ve rakip capped ya da aral\u0131\u011F\u0131 yo\u011Funsa kuru board b\xFCy\xFCk boyun evidir.",
