        "narration": "ICM a\xE7\u0131k. Chip cinsinden k\xE2rl\u0131 a\xE7\u0131l\u0131\u015F c\xFCmlesi arkadakilerin birbiriyle \xE7arp\u0131\u015Fma olas\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 fiyatlamaz. En net h\xE2li blind'e kar\u015F\u0131 blind: fold edersen small blind k\u0131sa ya da agresifse big blind'e geni\u015F jam'ler, big blind geni\u015F \xF6der, biri bust olur ve basamak sana yaz\u0131l\u0131r. Fold'un de\u011Feri \xE7arp\u0131\u015Fma ve bust olas\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131n \xE7arp\u0131m\u0131 \xE7arp\u0131 basama\u011F\u0131n de\u011Feridir; b\xFCy\xFCkse marjinal a\xE7\u0131l\u0131\u015F\u0131 ge\xE7er. Etki arkanda kalan oyuncu say\u0131s\u0131 ve profiliyle \xF6l\xE7eklenir: en y\xFCksek erken pozisyondan; button'dan tek yol kal\u0131r, do\u011Frudan blind sava\u015F\u0131; small blind'den s\u0131f\u0131r, \xE7arp\u0131\u015Facak \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC yoktur. Ka\xE7\u0131\u015F kap\u0131s\u0131: \xE7arp\u0131\u015Fma masas\u0131nda \xFC\xE7-bet'e devam e\u015Fi\u011Fini bir kademe yukar\u0131 al; orta-k\u0131sa bantta, kabaca yirmi ile yirmi be\u015F big blind, raise stack'in k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir dilimiyken ve arkanda iki agresif oyuncu varken as-kral tipi elle open-jam yerine fold opsiyonu sat\u0131n alan raise, biri itip \xF6b\xFCr\xFC yeniden itti\u011Finde katlan\u0131p basama\u011F\u0131 al\u0131rs\u0131n; jam ya da fold band\u0131nda bu kap\u0131 kapal\u0131d\u0131r, as-kral\u0131 it ya da at. E\u015Fikleri kendi solver'\u0131nda kalibre et."
