        ruleBox: "Frekans ezberi ta\u015F\u0131nmaz, e\u015Fik ta\u015F\u0131n\u0131r \u2014 okumaya check kolonundan ba\u015Fla, s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 tek kart-\xF6zelli\u011Fine ba\u011Fla.",
        narration: "Solver \xE7\u0131kt\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ilk a\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131nda frekanslar\u0131 ezberlemeye \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma; e\u015Fi\u011Fi oku. Her boy i\xE7in tek bir soru sor: bu boyla value'lanabilen en zay\u0131f el hangisi, ya da bir bete kar\u015F\u0131 fold etmeyen en zay\u0131f el hangisi. Kar\u0131\u015F\u0131m y\xFCzdeleri dengede e\u015F de\u011Ferdir, ezberi ta\u015F\u0131maz; ta\u015F\u0131nan \u015Fey e\u015Fiktir. E\u015Fi\u011Fin \xFCst\xFC yapabilirdir, s\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 sonra s\u0131n\u0131f seviyesinde ayarlars\u0131n. Agres\xF6r\xFCn flop \xE7\u0131kt\u0131s\u0131nda okuma s\u0131ras\u0131 da bellidir: bet kolonundan de\u011Fil, check kolonundan ba\u015Fla. En \xE7ok check isteyen s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131 bul; o s\u0131n\u0131f bile bete kar\u0131\u015F\u0131yorsa onun i\xE7in check ile bet e\u015F de\u011Ferdir, kalan s\u0131n\u0131flar zaten beti tercih eder. Bet frekans\u0131n\u0131n d\xFC\u015Ft\xFC\u011F\xFC yeri tek bir okunabilir kart \xF6zelli\u011Fine ba\u011Fla, mesela en d\xFC\u015F\xFCk kart \u015Fu rank\u0131n \xFCst\xFCndeyse bet, alt\u0131ndaysa check. \xC7izginin biraz keyf\xEE olmas\u0131 bir kusur de\u011Fil, tam tersine bir \xF6zelliktir; s\u0131n\u0131r elleri zaten e\u015F de\u011Ferdir ve keyf\xEE bir \xE7izgi masada ger\xE7ekten uygulanabilir."
