        ruleBox: "Strateji de\u011Fil ARALIK ezberle; yar\u0131dan fazlas\u0131yla b\xFCy\xFCk-bet dengede value de\u011Fildir \u2014 e\u015Fi\u011Fi y\xFCkselt.",
