        ruleBox: "Mix e\u015F-EV'dir, e\u015F-EV karar bedavad\u0131r \u2014 rec'e kar\u015F\u0131 sabitle ve exploit'i al; dengeyi yaln\u0131z sayana sakla.",
        narration: "Solver bir eli kar\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131yorsa, o el iki aksiyon aras\u0131nda kay\u0131ts\u0131z demektir; kar\u0131\u015F\u0131m ancak iki hatt\u0131n beklenen de\u011Feri neredeyse e\u015Fitken me\u015Frudur. Masaya \xE7evirisi \xE7ok pratiktir: kar\u0131\u015F\u0131k bir el bedava karard\u0131r. Onu tek bir tarafa sabitle. Hangi tarafa sabitleyece\u011Fini okuman s\xF6yler; okuman yoksa beklenen de\u011Ferin kayna\u011F\u0131 filtresine d\xF6n. Sabitlemeni node-lock ile s\u0131na: kar\u0131\u015F\u0131m\u0131 tek tarafa kilitle ve beklenen de\u011Fer kayb\u0131n\u0131 \xF6l\xE7; kay\u0131p k\xFC\xE7\xFCkse masaya ta\u015F\u0131n\u0131r, kural budur. Kar\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rman\u0131n kap\u0131s\u0131 rakip kalitesidir. Frekans\u0131n\u0131 saymayan zay\u0131f rakibe kar\u015F\u0131 saf oyna ve s\xF6m\xFCr\xFCy\xFC al. Denge yaln\u0131z seni ger\xE7ekten izleyen iyi rakibe kar\u015F\u0131 gerekir, ve orada bile seyrek doz yeter; pasif hatt\u0131nda ara s\u0131ra g\xFC\xE7l\xFC el g\xF6ster ki kar\u015F\u0131 uyum kap\u0131s\u0131 kapans\u0131n. Canl\u0131 oyunda araca da dikkat et: saate yaln\u0131z s\u0131n\u0131r ellerinde bak\u0131yorsan, o bak\u0131\u015F elini ele verir. Kar\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rman gerekiyorsa bir kart \xF6zelli\u011Fi kural\u0131 kullan, mesela bug\xFCn\xFCn agresif rengi, ve kural\u0131 her g\xFCn de\u011Fi\u015Ftir."
