          "Her sadele\u015Ftirme sonraki soka\u011Fa BOR\xC7 yazar: tam-aral\u0131k check probe savunmas\u0131 bor\xE7lar, tam-aral\u0131k bet barrel e\u015Fi\u011Fini s\u0131k\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131r."
