          "Kural \xE7ekerken tek node'a bakma; asgari-kontrast \xE7ifti kur: TEK de\u011Fi\u015Fkeni de\u011Fi\u015Ftir, deltay\u0131 oku \u2014 'neden'i iki d\xFC\u011F\xFCm aras\u0131 fark s\xF6yler.",
